{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118910/extras/a3c050a1782f6c30152a791a61483278.poster.avif?t=1770033847\" width=1020 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118910/extras/a3c050a1782f6c30152a791a61483278.webm?t=1770033847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118910/extras/a3c050a1782f6c30152a791a61483278.mp4?t=1770033847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever wanted to become a game developer? Have you ever imagined what would happen if your creativity became reality? Or even worse\u2026 when you can\u2019t tell what\u2019s real and what\u2019s not anymore?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is what <strong>Reality Breach</strong> is about.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reality Breach is a <strong>story-driven psychological horror</strong> where the tension doesn\u2019t come from endless jump scares, but from the slow collapse of your mind\u2014and the world around you.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WISHLIST NOW!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118910/extras/96b66a25370dc514426790ce2b2d3ad5.poster.avif?t=1770033847\" width=1020 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118910/extras/96b66a25370dc514426790ce2b2d3ad5.webm?t=1770033847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118910/extras/96b66a25370dc514426790ce2b2d3ad5.mp4?t=1770033847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Physical Threat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re being hunted. You should know your house well\u2026 but hiding won\u2019t keep you safe forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118910/extras/7d1c8e4bebba425d68fa2354de773358.poster.avif?t=1770033847\" width=1020 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118910/extras/7d1c8e4bebba425d68fa2354de773358.webm?t=1770033847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118910/extras/7d1c8e4bebba425d68fa2354de773358.mp4?t=1770033847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Psychological Threat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your environment twists against you. What once felt familiar is no longer recognizable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118910/extras/f7fb88f6d1ab752174526dd59e11977c.poster.avif?t=1770033847\" width=1020 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118910/extras/f7fb88f6d1ab752174526dd59e11977c.webm?t=1770033847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118910/extras/f7fb88f6d1ab752174526dd59e11977c.mp4?t=1770033847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Narrative Threat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This story has many ends. Which one will you choose?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118910/extras/8a53bd7dbe9592dae0e008027806c235.poster.avif?t=1770033847\" width=1020 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118910/extras/8a53bd7dbe9592dae0e008027806c235.webm?t=1770033847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118910/extras/8a53bd7dbe9592dae0e008027806c235.mp4?t=1770033847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ROADMAP &amp; PERSONAL NOTES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I\u2019m working on Reality Breach <strong>full-time</strong>. The game is nearly complete: content is finished, and I\u2019m now focused on <strong>polishing and bug fixes</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demo 2.0</strong> is coming soon, giving you the chance to try before you buy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You an track the progress through Trello, linked inside the website section.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The release is very close\u2026 this final push is all about making sure it feels right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for following the journey. Your <strong>wishlist and support mean everything</strong>.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3118910?t=1770033847","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118910/3ad7a5296b573d31f53c95924c58920883000e3b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770033847","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118910/396aaac1aba8bbeec82d78057f2c7700514815b5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770033847","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118910/396aaac1aba8bbeec82d78057f2c7700514815b5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770033847","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detaile