e being hunted. You should know your house well\u2026 but hiding won\u2019t keep you safe forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118910/extras/7d1c8e4bebba425d68fa2354de773358.poster.avif?t=1770033847\" width=1020 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118910/extras/7d1c8e4bebba425d68fa2354de773358.webm?t=1770033847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118910/extras/7d1c8e4bebba425d68fa2354de773358.mp4?t=1770033847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Psychological Threat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your environment twists against you. What once felt familiar is no longer recognizable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118910/extras/f7fb88f6d1ab752174526dd59e11977c.poster.avif?t=1770033847\" width=1020 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118910/extras/f7fb88f6d1ab752174526dd59e11977c.webm?t=1770033847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118910/extras/f7fb88f6d1ab752174526dd59e11977c.mp4?t=1770033847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Narrative Threat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This story has many ends. Which one will you choose?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118910/extras/8a53bd7dbe9592dae0e008027806c235.poster.avif?t=1770033847\" width=